<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Глава 5. Массивы и срезы on GoToGo</title><link>https://gotogolang.github.io/dojo/go-to-go/chapter-05/</link><description>Recent content in Глава 5. Массивы и срезы on GoToGo</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://gotogolang.github.io/dojo/go-to-go/chapter-05/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Массивы</title><link>https://gotogolang.github.io/dojo/go-to-go/chapter-05/01-arrays/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://gotogolang.github.io/dojo/go-to-go/chapter-05/01-arrays/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="объявление" class=link_owner>
 Объявление
 &lt;a href="#%d0%be%d0%b1%d1%8a%d1%8f%d0%b2%d0%bb%d0%b5%d0%bd%d0%b8%d0%b5" class="link icon">
 &lt;svg>
 &lt;use xlink:href="#anchor-link">&lt;/use>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Массив в Go имеет &lt;strong>фиксированный&lt;/strong> размер, который является частью типа. &lt;code>[3]int&lt;/code> и &lt;code>[5]int&lt;/code> — разные типы.&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kd">var&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">a&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">3&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1">// [0 0 0]&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">b&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">3&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">2&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">3&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">c&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">...&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">4&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">5&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">6&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1">// компилятор считает элементы сам&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="индексация-и-длина" class=link_owner>
 Индексация и длина
 &lt;a href="#%d0%b8%d0%bd%d0%b4%d0%b5%d0%ba%d1%81%d0%b0%d1%86%d0%b8%d1%8f-%d0%b8-%d0%b4%d0%bb%d0%b8%d0%bd%d0%b0" class="link icon">
 &lt;svg>
 &lt;use xlink:href="#anchor-link">&lt;/use>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">b&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">10&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">fmt&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">Println&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">b&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">])&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1">// 2&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">fmt&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">Println&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nb">len&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">b&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">))&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1">// 3&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>Выход за границы — паника во время выполнения. Обращение к отрицательному индексу — ошибка компиляции.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="массив--значение" class=link_owner>
 Массив — значение
 &lt;a href="#%d0%bc%d0%b0%d1%81%d1%81%d0%b8%d0%b2--%d0%b7%d0%bd%d0%b0%d1%87%d0%b5%d0%bd%d0%b8%d0%b5" class="link icon">
 &lt;svg>
 &lt;use xlink:href="#anchor-link">&lt;/use>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>В отличие от C, массив Go — &lt;strong>значение&lt;/strong>. Присваивание копирует все элементы:&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Срезы</title><link>https://gotogolang.github.io/dojo/go-to-go/chapter-05/02-slices/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://gotogolang.github.io/dojo/go-to-go/chapter-05/02-slices/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="срез--заголовок-над-массивом" class=link_owner>
 Срез — заголовок над массивом
 &lt;a href="#%d1%81%d1%80%d0%b5%d0%b7--%d0%b7%d0%b0%d0%b3%d0%be%d0%bb%d0%be%d0%b2%d0%be%d0%ba-%d0%bd%d0%b0%d0%b4-%d0%bc%d0%b0%d1%81%d1%81%d0%b8%d0%b2%d0%be%d0%bc" class="link icon">
 &lt;svg>
 &lt;use xlink:href="#anchor-link">&lt;/use>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Срез (&lt;code>[]T&lt;/code>) — это структура из трёх полей: указатель на массив, длина (&lt;code>len&lt;/code>) и ёмкость (&lt;code>cap&lt;/code>). Срез не владеет данными — он смотрит на фрагмент массива.&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">a&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">5&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">2&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">3&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">4&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">5&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">a&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">4&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1">// [2 3 4], len=3, cap=4&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>Изменение элементов через срез изменяет исходный массив.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="создание-среза" class=link_owner>
 Создание среза
 &lt;a href="#%d1%81%d0%be%d0%b7%d0%b4%d0%b0%d0%bd%d0%b8%d0%b5-%d1%81%d1%80%d0%b5%d0%b7%d0%b0" class="link icon">
 &lt;svg>
 &lt;use xlink:href="#anchor-link">&lt;/use>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">10&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">20&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">30&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1">// литерал&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">s2&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">make&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">([]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">5&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1">// len=5, cap=5, заполнен нулями&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">s3&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">make&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">([]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">3&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">10&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1">// len=3, cap=10&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="append" class=link_owner>
 append
 &lt;a href="#append" class="link icon">
 &lt;svg>
 &lt;use xlink:href="#anchor-link">&lt;/use>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>&lt;code>append&lt;/code> добавляет элементы. Если &lt;code>cap&lt;/code> не хватает, создаётся новый массив вдвое большего размера:&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Паттерны работы со срезами</title><link>https://gotogolang.github.io/dojo/go-to-go/chapter-05/03-slice-patterns/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://gotogolang.github.io/dojo/go-to-go/chapter-05/03-slice-patterns/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="удаление-элемента" class=link_owner>
 Удаление элемента
 &lt;a href="#%d1%83%d0%b4%d0%b0%d0%bb%d0%b5%d0%bd%d0%b8%d0%b5-%d1%8d%d0%bb%d0%b5%d0%bc%d0%b5%d0%bd%d1%82%d0%b0" class="link icon">
 &lt;svg>
 &lt;use xlink:href="#anchor-link">&lt;/use>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Удалить элемент по индексу &lt;code>i&lt;/code>, сохранив порядок:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">append&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">i&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">],&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">i&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">+&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">...&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>Без сохранения порядка (быстрее — без сдвига):&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">i&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nb">len&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">-&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nb">len&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">-&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="фильтрация-на-месте" class=link_owner>
 Фильтрация на месте
 &lt;a href="#%d1%84%d0%b8%d0%bb%d1%8c%d1%82%d1%80%d0%b0%d1%86%d0%b8%d1%8f-%d0%bd%d0%b0-%d0%bc%d0%b5%d1%81%d1%82%d0%b5" class="link icon">
 &lt;svg>
 &lt;use xlink:href="#anchor-link">&lt;/use>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Принцип «write pointer» — перезаписываем срез прямо в себя:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kd">func&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">filter&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">keep&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kd">func&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">bool&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">n&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">for&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">_&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">v&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">range&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">keep&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">v&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">n&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">v&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">n&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">++&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">n&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="двумерные-срезы" class=link_owner>
 Двумерные срезы
 &lt;a href="#%d0%b4%d0%b2%d1%83%d0%bc%d0%b5%d1%80%d0%bd%d1%8b%d0%b5-%d1%81%d1%80%d0%b5%d0%b7%d1%8b" class="link icon">
 &lt;svg>
 &lt;use xlink:href="#anchor-link">&lt;/use>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">matrix&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">make&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">([][]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">3&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">for&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">i&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">range&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">matrix&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">matrix&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">i&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">make&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">([]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">4&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">matrix&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">][&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">2&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">7&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="nil-срез-vs-пустой-срез" class=link_owner>
 nil-срез vs пустой срез
 &lt;a href="#nil-%d1%81%d1%80%d0%b5%d0%b7-vs-%d0%bf%d1%83%d1%81%d1%82%d0%be%d0%b9-%d1%81%d1%80%d0%b5%d0%b7" class="link icon">
 &lt;svg>
 &lt;use xlink:href="#anchor-link">&lt;/use>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kd">var&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1">// nil-срез: s == nil, len=0&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">s2&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">{}&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1">// пустой: s2 != nil, len=0&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>Оба допускают &lt;code>append&lt;/code>, итерацию &lt;code>range&lt;/code> и передачу в функции. Различие важно только при сериализации в JSON: nil → &lt;code>null&lt;/code>, &lt;code>[]int{}&lt;/code> → &lt;code>[]&lt;/code>.&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>